#: tycontrols.design.propeditors.rsdtsurfacepurposetext
msgid ""
"TyFormSurface is the content host of a TTyForm — the panel every control on the form lives on.\n"
"\n"
"A borderless, resizable window cannot paint its own outermost pixels: the compositor gives it a backing surface smaller than the window, which leaves an unpainted band along the right and bottom edges. A CHILD window has no such limit and paints edge to edge, so TTyForm renders its themed background onto this surface instead of onto itself.\n"
"\n"
"Your controls must live on the surface. Graphic (windowless) controls such as TTyLabel paint onto their parent, so one placed directly on the form is hidden behind the surface.\n"
"\n"
"Keep exactly one surface per form, leave it filling the form, and do not delete it."
msgstr ""
"TyFormSurface 是 TTyForm 的内容宿主 —— 窗体上所有控件都放在这个面板里。\n"
"\n"
"无边框且可缩放的窗口画不到自己最外圈的像素:合成器给它的后备绘制面比窗口本身小,于是右边和下边会留下一条画不到的空带。子窗口没有这个限制、能一直画到真正的边缘,所以 TTyForm 把主题背景画在这个 surface 上,而不是画在自己身上。\n"
"\n"
"你的控件必须放在 surface 里。像 TTyLabel 这类图形(无窗口)控件是画在父控件身上的,直接放在窗体上会被 surface 挡住、看不见。\n"
"\n"
"每个窗体只保留一个 surface,让它铺满窗体,不要删除它。"

